Package: lipidflowshiny
Title: Web Interface for LipidFlow Lipidomics Workflows
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person(given = "Yijiang", family = "TODO", email = "TODO@ntu.edu.sg", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny web interface for the lipidflow ecosystem. Provides
    browser-based access to untargeted lipidomics peak picking, lipid
    annotation, and internal-standard-based absolute quantification.
    The quantification module wraps
    lipidflow::get_lipid_absolute_quantification(). Peak picking and
    lipid annotation modules are placeholders pending development -
    see README for the planned build order.
